 terrible emergency -- aid my escape -- and though I feel I shall never live to thank you , the _ silent suppliant _ will remind you by its smiles of the tears that I now shed ; and if they are shed in vain , its smile will have a bitter eloquence as it plays with the flowers on its mother ’s grave ! ”
